[en.FOCUS_C14_NEW_PARTNER_PEAR]
Unite Pear Family

[en.FOCUS_C14_NEW_PARTNER_PEAR_desc]
“THEY CAME FIRST for the Apple Family, and I didn’t speak up because I wasn’t an Apple. THEN THEY CAME for the Cherry Family, and I didn’t speak up because I wasn’t a Cherry. THEN THEY CAME for the Seed Family, and I didn’t speak up because I wasn’t a Seed. THEN THEY CAME for the Pear Family, and by that time no one was left to speak up.” — Martin Pear, Pear Family poet

[zh.FOCUS_C14_NEW_PARTNER_PEAR]
联合梨家族

[zh.FOCUS_C14_NEW_PARTNER_PEAR_desc]
“起初他们针对苹果家族，我没有站出来，因为我不是苹果。然后他们针对樱桃家族，我没有站出来，因为我不是樱桃。然后他们针对种子家族，我没有站出来，因为我不是种子。然后他们针对梨家族，那时已经没有小马站出来了为我说话了。” —— 马丁·梨，梨家族诗歌作者

